From 461287638b8d024b25996f4cea5fda026bf841dc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: yurich <urvancevurij24@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 05:25:27 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] fix(front): give Yandex sign-ups an avatar and the example
 network (#539)

yandex_callback created the user with nick/yandex_id/email only, while VK
sign-up also downloads the profile picture and creates the 'switch and hub'
example network. Extract both steps from vk_callback into
download_avatar() and create_example_network() and use them for Yandex too.

The Yandex picture comes from login.yandex.ru/info: default_avatar_id ->
https://avatars.yandex.net/get-yapic/<id>/islands-200, skipped when
is_avatar_empty marks the placeholder (format per
https://yandex.ru/dev/id/doc/ru/user-information). Note: the field is only
returned if the OAuth app has the 'user profile picture' permission - worth
checking in the production app settings.

VK behaviour is unchanged (same helper, same fallback to empty.jpg).
Checked end-to-end on a local DB with only the OAuth exchange faked: new
user gets the downloaded avatar and the example network. Adds browser-free
test_yandex_registration.py (registered in front_coverage.yml).
